{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e08cd6006945d27fc52f","chatId":"8ce9d156d5704faf8f11523e9a7ad335","sessionId":null,"userId":51517,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":841,"promptTokens":1559,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:08"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035929596139084763,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e08cd6006945d27fc52e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367628582,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e08cd6006945d27fc52e","chatId":"8ce9d156d5704faf8f11523e9a7ad335","sessionId":null,"userId":51517,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n李明是一位热心社区的居民，他在社区公园种植了一棵珍贵的果树。有一天，他忘记给果树浇水。王刚，一个不经常来公园的居民，误以为这棵树是病树，决定砍掉它防止病害蔓延。与此同时，赵丽是李明的邻居，她看到了王刚的行为，但由于她与李明有私人恩怨，决定不阻止王刚。当李明发现树被砍时，他感到非常伤心，并开始询问周围人。最终，王刚意识到他可能误判了情况。\n\n[问题]\n赵丽看到王刚砍树却没有阻止，她会感到什么样的情绪？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 赵丽可能感到无动于衷，因为她认为这与她无关。\nB. 赵丽可能会感到满意和幸灾乐祸，因为她认为这会给她与李明的矛盾带来优势。\nC. 赵丽可能感到担忧，担心李明会怀疑她的动机。\nD. 赵丽可能感到难过，因为她无法阻止王刚的行为。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035929596139084763,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e08cd6006945d27fc52f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367628579,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f7eeb54d29fc42d8a3a7435d81919a27"}